OL,3,GNEWSAFlats plan on edge of city centre
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a block of more than 40
OL,7,Fflats on the edge of Leicester city
OL,8,Fcentre have been approved.
OL,10,FNest Properties Ltd submitted a
OL,11,Fplanning application to Leicester City
OL,12,FCouncil earlier this year to demolish
OL,13,Fbuildings between 169-177 Walnut Street
OL,14,Fand replace them with a five-storey
OL,15,Fproperty.
OL,17,FAccording to planning documents, the
OL,18,Fproposed development would consist of
OL,19,F31 one-bed flats and 11 two-bed flats,
OL,20,Fas well as office space on the ground
OL,21,Ffloor.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
